    "Ready for review · %d of %d checks": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ready for review · %d of %d checks"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"等待审阅 · 已检查 %d 项，共 %d 项"}}}},
    "Stopped on your computer": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stopped on your computer"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已在电脑上停止"}}}},
    "Stopped: Isoform restarted": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stopped: Isoform restarted"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已停止：Isoform 已重新启动"}}}},
