    "More arrive after %@": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"More arrive after %@"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 后会有更多建议"}}}},
    "Couldn't find more tasks. Try again.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Couldn't find more tasks. Try again."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未能找到更多任务，请重试。"}}}},
    "Nothing new right now. Try again later.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nothing new right now. Try again later."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂时没有新建议，稍后再试。"}}}},
    "Work started on your computer": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Work started on your computer"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"任务已在电脑上开始"}}}},
    "Couldn't start this task. Try again.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Couldn't start this task. Try again."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法开始此任务，请重试。"}}}},
    "%lld things need you": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%lld things need you"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%lld 件事需要你"}}}},
    "Keep your computer awake while it's plugged in": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keep this computer awake while your phone is paired"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手机配对期间让这台电脑保持唤醒"}}}},
    "So this phone can reach it while it's plugged in. The screen still turns off. A closed laptop still sleeps.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"So your phone can reach it while it's plugged in. The screen still turns off. A closed laptop still sleeps."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这样接通电源时你的手机能连上它。屏幕仍会关闭。合上盖子的笔记本电脑仍会睡眠。"}}}},
    "Changes apply when your computer is back.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Changes apply when your computer is back."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"电脑恢复连接后生效。"}}}},
    "To reach it while it's plugged in, keep it awake for your phone.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"To reach it while it's plugged in, keep it awake for your phone."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"接通电源时让电脑保持唤醒，手机就能随时连上它。"}}}},
    "Turn on": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Turn on"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打开"}}}},
