    "Turns on when your computer is back.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Turns on when your computer is back."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"电脑恢复连接后打开。"}}}},
    "Your phone checks your computer every so often, so a notice can come a little late.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your phone checks your computer every so often, so a notice can come a little late."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的手机会不时检查你的电脑，所以通知可能会稍晚一些到。"}}}},
    "Agent of You" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent of You"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent of You"}}}},
    "Your phone checks your computer every so often, so a notice can come a little late. While your computer is asleep, nothing new arrives.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your phone checks your computer every so often, so a notice can come a little late. While your computer is asleep, nothing new arrives."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的手机会不时检查你的电脑，所以通知可能会稍晚一些到。电脑睡眠时不会有新通知。"}}}},
    "Soon": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Soon"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"即将推出"}}}},
    "Coming soon": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Coming soon"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"即将推出"}}}},
    "It works the way you do, makes things for them in minutes, and you get paid for every minute it works.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"It works the way you do, makes things for them in minutes, and you get paid for every minute it works."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"它按你的方式做事，几分钟就交付，它工作的每一分钟你都有收入。"}}}},
    "What it would specialize in": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"What it would specialize in"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"它会擅长的事"}}}},
    "From what Isoform learned on your computer.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"From what Isoform learned on your computer."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"来自 Isoform 在你的电脑上学到的内容。"}}}},
    "Isoform is still learning how you work. Your specialties show here once it has seen you do something a few times.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Isoform is still learning how you work. Your specialties show here once it has seen you do something a few times."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Isoform 还在了解你的工作方式。多看你做几次之后，你擅长的事就会显示在这里。"}}}},
